──────────────────────────────────────────────────
AI assistance
──────────────────────────────────────────────────

Part of the code, documentation and tests was written with the help of a
language model (Claude, Anthropic), under the maintainer's direction. The
maintainer tests it and reports the defects found, but no longer reviews all
of the code line by line: checking relies mainly on the repository's tests
(ci/bancs.sh), which anyone can re-run. It is stated here, once and for all.
